# libvirt-lxc named split (builder named-splits mechanism): the LXC
# driver set, partitioned out of the single canonical build. Every
# path below is certain: the daemon binary, driver module and default
# config come from -Ddriver_lxc=enabled (meson-verified), and the two
# units are installed by recipe_install itself. Explicit lists fail
# closed on missing paths. Forward-compatible: inert under the
# pre-splits builder (virtlxcd ships in main), activates with the
# splits toolchain. No .depends: the driver links nothing beyond the
# main package closure.
usr/sbin/virtlxcd
usr/lib/libvirt/connection-driver/libvirt_driver_lxc.so
etc/libvirt/lxc.conf
etc/init.d/virtlxcd
usr/lib/systemd/system/virtlxcd.service
